# Build context filter for Dockerfile.bench (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore). Allow-list: only what the build reads.
*
!third_party/fetch_rtf.sh
!third_party/patches
!tools/transciphering

# Inside tools/transciphering: no local results, no editor/build debris.
tools/transciphering/results
**/.venv
**/data
**/artifacts
**/build
**/*.test
**/__pycache__
# The checkout is fetched fresh inside the image, never copied from the host.
**/RtF-Transciphering
